    "interpretation": "Q1->Q2 large step + Q2-Q4 plateau pattern: CER jumps at 'any overlap presence' (binary) then is flat across Q2-Q4 dose range. This is a threshold/binary-presence pattern, NOT a continuous monotonic dose response."
